{"seq":4,"slug":"performance-optimization","title":"性能优化","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/vue-in-depth/ecosystem-and-patterns/performance-optimization","wordCount":652,"readingTime":3,"html":"<h1 id=\"性能优化\">性能优化</h1><h2 id=\"vue-应用性能全景\">Vue 应用性能全景</h2><p>Vue 应用的性能优化涵盖多个层面：渲染效率、包体积、运行时内存和网络加载。理解 Vue 的渲染机制是做出正确优化决策的前提。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    Perf[&quot;性能优化&quot;]&#10;    Perf --&gt; Render[&quot;渲染优化&quot;]&#10;    Perf --&gt; Bundle[&quot;包体积优化&quot;]&#10;    Perf --&gt; Runtime[&quot;运行时优化&quot;]&#10;    Perf --&gt; Network[&quot;网络优化&quot;]&#10;    Render --&gt; VD[&quot;虚拟 DOM 优化&quot;]&#10;    Render --&gt; Memo[&quot;v-memo / v-once&quot;]&#10;    Bundle --&gt; Split[&quot;代码分割&quot;]&#10;    Bundle --&gt; TreeShake[&quot;Tree Shaking&quot;]&#10;    Runtime --&gt; Shallow[&quot;shallowRef&quot;]&#10;    Runtime --&gt; Virtual[&quot;虚拟滚动&quot;]&#10;    Network --&gt; Lazy[&quot;懒加载&quot;]&#10;    Network --&gt; Prefetch[&quot;预获取&quot;]\">flowchart TD\n    Perf[\"性能优化\"]\n    Perf --&gt; Render[\"渲染优化\"]\n    Perf --&gt; Bundle[\"包体积优化\"]\n    Perf --&gt; Runtime[\"运行时优化\"]\n    Perf --&gt; Network[\"网络优化\"]\n    Render --&gt; VD[\"虚拟 DOM 优化\"]\n    Render --&gt; Memo[\"v-memo / v-once\"]\n    Bundle --&gt; Split[\"代码分割\"]\n    Bundle --&gt; TreeShake[\"Tree Shaking\"]\n    Runtime --&gt; Shallow[\"shallowRef\"]\n    Runtime --&gt; Virtual[\"虚拟滚动\"]\n    Network --&gt; Lazy[\"懒加载\"]\n    Network --&gt; Prefetch[\"预获取\"]</pre><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>渲染优化</strong>：减少虚拟 DOM 的比对与 DOM 操作量，手段包括虚拟滚动、<code>v-memo</code>、<code>v-once</code>。</li>\n<li><strong>响应式开销</strong>：深层代理会给大对象带来持续成本，<code>shallowRef</code> / <code>shallowReactive</code> 用放弃深层追踪换取性能。</li>\n<li><strong>包体积优化</strong>：Tree Shaking、代码分割、压缩、CDN 外部化共同决定首屏加载量。</li>\n<li><strong>Lazy Hydration</strong>：SSR 场景下延迟非关键组件的激活，直接改善 TTI。</li>\n<li><strong>量化指标</strong>：FCP、LCP、TTI、CLS、FID 是判断优化是否有效的客观依据，先测量再优化。</li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"虚拟滚动\">虚拟滚动</h2><p>当列表包含成千上万条数据时，一次渲染所有 DOM 节点会严重影响性能。虚拟滚动只渲染可视区域内的元素：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"vue\" data-code=\"&lt;script setup lang=&quot;ts&quot;&gt;&#10;import { ref } from &#39;vue&#39;;&#10;import { useVirtualList } from &#39;@vueuse/core&#39;;&#10;&#10;interface ListItem {&#10;  id: number;&#10;  title: string;&#10;  description: string;&#10;}&#10;&#10;const allItems = ref&lt;ListItem[]&gt;(&#10;  Array.from({ length: 100000 }, (_, i) =&gt; ({&#10;    id: i,&#10;    title: `项目 ${i}`,&#10;    description: `这是第 ${i} 个项目的描述`,&#10;  })),&#10;);&#10;&#10;const { list, containerProps, wrapperProps } = useVirtualList(allItems, {&#10;  itemHeight: 60,&#10;});&#10;&lt;/script&gt;&#10;&#10;&lt;template&gt;&#10;  &lt;div v-bind=&quot;containerProps&quot; class=&quot;list-container&quot;&gt;&#10;    &lt;div v-bind=&quot;wrapperProps&quot;&gt;&#10;      &lt;div v-for=&quot;{ data, index } in list&quot; :key=&quot;data.id&quot; class=&quot;list-item&quot;&gt;&#10;        &lt;span&gt;{{ data.title }}&lt;/span&gt;&#10;        &lt;p&gt;{{ data.description }}&lt;/p&gt;&#10;      &lt;/div&gt;&#10;    &lt;/div&gt;&#10;  &lt;/div&gt;&#10;&lt;/template&gt;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>&#x3C;script setup lang=\"ts\"></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>import { ref } from 'vue';</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>import { useVirtualList } from '@vueuse/core';</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>interface ListItem {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  id: number;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  title: string;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  description: string;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const allItems = ref&#x3C;ListItem[]>(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  Array.from({ length: 100000 }, (_, i) => ({</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    id: i,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    title: `项目 ${i}`,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    description: `这是第 ${i} 个项目的描述`,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  })),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const { list, containerProps, wrapperProps } = useVirtualList(allItems, {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  itemHeight: 60,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>});</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>&#x3C;/script></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>&#x3C;template></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  &#x3C;div v-bind=\"containerProps\" class=\"list-container\"></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    &#x3C;div v-bind=\"wrapperProps\"></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      &#x3C;div v-for=\"{ data, index } in list\" :key=\"data.id\" class=\"list-item\"></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        &#x3C;span>{{ data.title }}&#x3C;/span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        &#x3C;p>{{ data.description }}&#x3C;/p></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      &#x3C;/div></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    &#x3C;/div></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  &#x3C;/div></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>&#x3C;/template></span></span></code></pre></div><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;    subgraph Without[&quot;无虚拟滚动&quot;]&#10;        A1[&quot;渲染 100,000 个 DOM 节点&quot;]&#10;        A1 --&gt; A2[&quot;内存占用大、渲染慢&quot;]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph With[&quot;虚拟滚动&quot;]&#10;        B1[&quot;仅渲染可视区 20-30 个节点&quot;]&#10;        B1 --&gt; B2[&quot;流畅、低内存&quot;]&#10;    end\">flowchart LR\n    subgraph Without[\"无虚拟滚动\"]\n        A1[\"渲染 100,000 个 DOM 节点\"]\n        A1 --&gt; A2[\"内存占用大、渲染慢\"]\n    end\n    subgraph With[\"虚拟滚动\"]\n        B1[\"仅渲染可视区 20-30 个节点\"]\n        B1 --&gt; B2[\"流畅、低内存\"]\n    end</pre><hr>\n<h2 id=\"v-memo\">v-memo</h2><p><code>v-memo</code> 指令（Vue 3.2+）根据依赖数组决定是否跳过子树更新，对大型列表特别有效：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"vue\" data-code=\"&lt;template&gt;&#10;  &lt;div v-for=&quot;item in list&quot; :key=&quot;item.id&quot; v-memo=&quot;[item.id === selected]&quot;&gt;&#10;    &lt;p&gt;{{ item.name }}&lt;/p&gt;&#10;    &lt;span :class=&quot;{ active: item.id === selected }&quot;&gt;&#10;      {{ item.id === selected ? &#39;已选中&#39; : &#39;未选中&#39; }}&#10;    &lt;/span&gt;&#10;  &lt;/div&gt;&#10;&lt;/template&gt;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>&#x3C;template></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  &#x3C;div v-for=\"item in list\" :key=\"item.id\" v-memo=\"[item.id === selected]\"></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    &#x3C;p>{{ item.name }}&#x3C;/p></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    &#x3C;span :class=\"{ active: item.id === selected }\"></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      {{ item.id === selected ? '已选中' : '未选中' }}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    &#x3C;/span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  &#x3C;/div></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>&#x3C;/template></span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>指令</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>v-once</code></td>\n<td>只渲染一次，永不更新</td>\n<td>纯静态内容</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>v-memo</code></td>\n<td>依赖不变时跳过更新</td>\n<td>大型列表的条件更新</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"shallowref-与-shallowreactive\">shallowRef 与 shallowReactive</h2><p>对于大型数据结构，避免深层响应式转换可以显著提升性能：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"import { shallowRef, triggerRef } from &#39;vue&#39;;&#10;&#10;interface ChartData {&#10;  labels: string[];&#10;  datasets: Array&lt;{&#10;    data: number[];&#10;    backgroundColor: string;&#10;  }&gt;;&#10;}&#10;&#10;const chartData = shallowRef&lt;ChartData&gt;({&#10;  labels: Array.from({ length: 1000 }, (_, i) =&gt; `Label ${i}`),&#10;  datasets: [&#10;    {&#10;      data: Array.from({ length: 1000 }, () =&gt; Math.random() * 100),&#10;      backgroundColor: &#39;#42b883&#39;,&#10;    },&#10;  ],&#10;});&#10;&#10;function updateChart() {&#10;  chartData.value.datasets[0].data = chartData.value.datasets[0].data.map(() =&gt; Math.random() * 100);&#10;  triggerRef(chartData);&#10;}&#10;&#10;function replaceChart(newData: ChartData) {&#10;  chartData.value = newData;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { shallowRef, triggerRef } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'vue'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ChartData</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  labels</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  datasets</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Array</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    data</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    backgroundColor</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }>;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> chartData</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> shallowRef</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">ChartData</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>({</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  labels: Array.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">from</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({ length: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1000</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }, (</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">_</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">i</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> `Label ${</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">i</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">}`</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  datasets: [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      data: Array.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">from</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({ length: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1000</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }, () </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Math.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">random</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 100</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      backgroundColor: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'#42b883'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  ],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">});</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> updateChart</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  chartData.value.datasets[</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">].data </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> chartData.value.datasets[</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">].data.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">map</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(() </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Math.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">random</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 100</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  triggerRef</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(chartData);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> replaceChart</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">newData</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ChartData</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  chartData.value </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> newData;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    subgraph Deep[&quot;ref(深层响应式)&quot;]&#10;        D1[&quot;代理整个对象树&quot;]&#10;        D1 --&gt; D2[&quot;每个嵌套属性都是响应式&quot;]&#10;        D2 --&gt; D3[&quot;内存开销大&quot;]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph Shallow[&quot;shallowRef&quot;]&#10;        S1[&quot;仅追踪 .value 替换&quot;]&#10;        S1 --&gt; S2[&quot;嵌套属性不代理&quot;]&#10;        S2 --&gt; S3[&quot;内存开销小&quot;]&#10;    end\">flowchart TD\n    subgraph Deep[\"ref(深层响应式)\"]\n        D1[\"代理整个对象树\"]\n        D1 --&gt; D2[\"每个嵌套属性都是响应式\"]\n        D2 --&gt; D3[\"内存开销大\"]\n    end\n    subgraph Shallow[\"shallowRef\"]\n        S1[\"仅追踪 .value 替换\"]\n        S1 --&gt; S2[\"嵌套属性不代理\"]\n        S2 --&gt; S3[\"内存开销小\"]\n    end</pre><hr>\n<h2 id=\"lazy-hydration\">Lazy Hydration</h2><p>在 SSR 场景下，并非所有组件都需要在首屏时 hydrate。延迟 hydration 可以加速 TTI（Time to Interactive）：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"vue\" data-code=\"&lt;!-- Nuxt 3.4+ --&gt;&#10;&lt;template&gt;&#10;  &lt;LazyHeader /&gt;&#10;&#10;  &lt;main&gt;&#10;    &lt;NuxtPage /&gt;&#10;  &lt;/main&gt;&#10;&#10;  &lt;!-- 滚动到可见时才 hydrate --&gt;&#10;  &lt;LazyFooter /&gt;&#10;&lt;/template&gt;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>&#x3C;!-- Nuxt 3.4+ --></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>&#x3C;template></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  &#x3C;LazyHeader /></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  &#x3C;main></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    &#x3C;NuxtPage /></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  &#x3C;/main></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  &#x3C;!-- 滚动到可见时才 hydrate --></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  &#x3C;LazyFooter /></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>&#x3C;/template></span></span></code></pre></div><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"// nuxt.config.ts&#10;export default defineNuxtConfig({&#10;  experimental: {&#10;    componentIslands: true,&#10;  },&#10;});\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// nuxt.config.ts</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">export</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> default</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> defineNuxtConfig</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  experimental: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    componentIslands: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">});</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"包体积分析\">包体积分析</h2><h3 id=\"rollup-plugin-visualizer\">rollup-plugin-visualizer</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"// vite.config.ts&#10;import { visualizer } from &#39;rollup-plugin-visualizer&#39;;&#10;&#10;export default defineConfig({&#10;  plugins: [&#10;    vue(),&#10;    visualizer({&#10;  